{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-curve","title":"学习曲线与心流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations/learning-curve","wordCount":1671,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"学习曲线与心流\">学习曲线与心流</h1><p>为什么有的开场让人忘记时间，有的让人忍不住看进度条？答案藏在两条曲线的关系里：玩家的<strong>技能</strong>随时间增长的曲线，和游戏抛出的<strong>挑战</strong>随时间上升的曲线。当这两条线贴得足够近，玩家进入心理学家米哈里·契克森米哈赖（Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi）所说的&quot;心流&quot;——既不焦虑也不无聊的全神贯注状态。新手引导的全部技术，归根结底都是在让这两条线在头几分钟里始终保持着恰到好处的距离。</p>\n<p>上一篇 <a href=\"why-onboarding\">为何新手引导</a> 把引导的&quot;教学密度&quot;和留存说成倒 U 形曲线，并把最优点的确定权交给了本篇。现在来兑现：那个最优点，就是让玩家持续处于心流通道里的那条路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>心流模型把玩家的体验放进一张以&quot;挑战难度&quot;为纵轴、&quot;技能水平&quot;为横轴的图里。对角线附近是心流通道；通道之上是挑战远超技能的<strong>焦虑区</strong>，玩家因看不懂、打不过而恐慌；通道之下是技能远超挑战的<strong>无聊区</strong>，玩家因太简单、没新意而走神。引导的工作，就是让新玩家这个&quot;技能极低&quot;的点，始终被安排在与其匹配的低挑战上，再随着技能增长同步抬高挑战。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[玩家进入:技能极低] --&gt; B{挑战与技能是否匹配}&#10;  B --&gt;|挑战远高| C[焦虑区:看不懂打不过]&#10;  B --&gt;|挑战远低| D[无聊区:太简单走神]&#10;  B --&gt;|大致匹配| E[心流通道:全神贯注]&#10;  C --&gt; F[流失:挫败]&#10;  D --&gt; G[流失:乏味]&#10;  E --&gt; H[技能提升]&#10;  H --&gt; I[同步抬高挑战]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[玩家进入:技能极低] --&gt; B{挑战与技能是否匹配}\n  B --&gt;|挑战远高| C[焦虑区:看不懂打不过]\n  B --&gt;|挑战远低| D[无聊区:太简单走神]\n  B --&gt;|大致匹配| E[心流通道:全神贯注]\n  C --&gt; F[流失:挫败]\n  D --&gt; G[流失:乏味]\n  E --&gt; H[技能提升]\n  H --&gt; I[同步抬高挑战]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><p>下表把三个区域的体感、对应的引导失败、以及修正方向并排，方便后续诊断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>玩家体感</th>\n<th>对应引导失败</th>\n<th>修正方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>焦虑区</td>\n<td>慌、挫败、想放弃</td>\n<td>教得太晚/太少，一次抛太多</td>\n<td>拆细、放慢、就地教（<a href=\"../techniques/contextual-teaching\">情境化教学</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心流通道</td>\n<td>投入、忘记时间</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>维持，逐步抬挑战</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无聊区</td>\n<td>乏味、走神</td>\n<td>教得太多/太慢，乐趣来太晚</td>\n<td>提速、可跳过（<a href=\"../structure/skippable-adaptive\">可跳过与自适应</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习曲线的形状不该被压平\">学习曲线的形状不该被压平</h2><p>直觉上，&quot;降低学习成本&quot;似乎等于&quot;把学习曲线压得越平越好&quot;。这是个常见误解。一条完全平坦的曲线意味着玩家从头到尾没学到任何新东西——那正是无聊区。好的引导不追求平坦，而追求<strong>平滑且持续上升</strong>：每一小段时间都有新东西要学、要掌握，但每一步的增量都小到玩家踮踮脚就能够到。</p>\n<p>可以用一个简化模型描述这种&quot;踮脚&quot;状态。设玩家在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的技能为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，游戏抛出的挑战为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，把瞬时挫败感建模为二者之差经过一个非线性放大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>frustration</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{frustration}(t) = \\max\\big(0,\\ c(t) - s(t)\\big)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frustration</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.404em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平方项意味着挑战略高于技能时玩家只是轻微紧张（这正是心流所需的张力），但一旦差距拉开，挫败感急剧膨胀。引导的目标不是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t) = s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（那是无聊区），而是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t) - s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 维持在一个小的正值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 附近：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>δ</mi><mtext> 小</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t) \\approx s(t) + \\delta,\\quad \\delta &gt; 0,\\ \\delta \\ \\text{小}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个小小的正缺口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，就是&quot;踮脚感&quot;的数学表达，也是后面 <a href=\"../structure/staged-complexity\">渐进复杂度</a> 里&quot;一次只引入一个新变量&quot;原则的理论来源——每引入一个新变量，就是给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 加一个可控的小台阶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新手的技能起点低且斜率陡\">新手的技能起点低且斜率陡</h2><p>新玩家与老玩家在这张图上的关键差别，不在挑战曲线，而在技能曲线的<strong>起点</strong>和<strong>早期斜率</strong>。新玩家的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 接近零：他不知道按钮、不懂目标、没有肌肉记忆。但好消息是早期斜率极陡——头几分钟里，每教会一个操作，技能就跳一大格。这解释了为什么引导阶段&quot;密度敏感&quot;：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 还很低时，挑战 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 哪怕抬高一点点，差距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c-s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的相对值都很大，玩家立刻被推进焦虑区。</p>\n<p>这也解释了一个看似矛盾的现象：同一段教学内容，对老玩家是无聊区（他的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 已经很高，这点挑战毫无张力），对新玩家却可能是焦虑区。一套对所有人一视同仁的引导，注定同时得罪两头。化解之道是让引导能感知玩家当前的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 并据此调节——这正是 <a href=\"../structure/skippable-adaptive\">可跳过与自适应</a> 要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度预算-工作记忆的硬上限\">复杂度预算：工作记忆的硬上限</h2><p>心流通道还有一条物理边界：人的工作记忆。认知科学的经典结论是，人一次能在脑中活跃保持的信息块（chunk）大约只有 4 个左右。新玩家面对的每一个新规则、新按钮、新术语，都占用一个 chunk。一旦同时抛出的新概念超过这个上限，无论难度本身高低，玩家都会进入&quot;过载&quot;——表现为焦虑区，但根因是记忆溢出而非挑战过高。</p>\n<p>因此引导设计有一个隐形的&quot;复杂度预算&quot;：任一时刻屏幕上要求玩家同时持有的新概念数，应当远小于工作记忆上限。把预算花光的那一刻，就是必须停下来让玩家<strong>练习、消化、形成 chunk</strong>的那一刻——练熟的操作会从工作记忆沉淀为长期记忆，腾出预算给下一个新概念。这条预算约束是 <a href=\"../structure/pacing-gating\">节奏与解锁</a> 里功能门控的认知依据：门控不是为了藏东西，而是为了不超支这份预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>心流是挑战与技能大致匹配时的全神贯注状态；挑战远高于技能进入焦虑区，远低于则进入无聊区，两者都导致流失。</li>\n<li>好的引导不压平学习曲线，而让它平滑持续上升；用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t) \\approx s(t) + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 维持一个小的正缺口，制造&quot;踮脚感&quot;。</li>\n<li>新玩家技能起点近零但早期斜率陡，故引导阶段对教学密度极其敏感；一刀切的引导会同时得罪新老玩家。</li>\n<li>工作记忆约 4 个 chunk 的上限构成&quot;复杂度预算&quot;，超支即过载；门控与练习是为了在预算内消化、沉淀。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>把心流理论落成具体教学时机的第一种手段：<a href=\"../techniques/contextual-teaching\">情境化教学</a></li>\n<li>复杂度预算如何转化为投放节奏：<a href=\"../structure/pacing-gating\">节奏与解锁</a></li>\n<li>一次只引入一个新变量的结构原则：<a href=\"../structure/staged-complexity\">渐进复杂度</a></li>\n<li>跨库——挑战曲线在关卡层面的设计：<a href=\"../../level-design/pacing-flow/difficulty-curves\">关卡设计 · 难度曲线</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>概念来源：Mihaly Csikszentmihalyi《Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience》心流模型；工作记忆容量参见 Cowan (2001) 关于约 4 个 chunk 的综述。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"学习曲线与心流","id":"学习曲线与心流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"学习曲线的形状不该被压平","id":"学习曲线的形状不该被压平"},{"level":2,"text":"新手的技能起点低且斜率陡","id":"新手的技能起点低且斜率陡"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度预算：工作记忆的硬上限","id":"复杂度预算-工作记忆的硬上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何新手引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations/why-onboarding"},"next":{"title":"教学手段谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations/teaching-methods-spectrum"}}